WEBVTT

00:03.850 --> 00:05.100
<b>What?</b>

00:05.100 --> 00:08.650
<b>The cleaner slime ate charcoal?!</b>

00:08.650 --> 00:15.320
<b>Yes. I'm sorry to spring that on you,
when you've just returned from Lenaf.</b>

00:15.320 --> 00:17.950
<b>You mentioned that the charcoal
you placed in the kitchen</b>

00:17.950 --> 00:23.000
<b>had good effects, like clean the air
and decrease humidity, right?</b>

00:23.000 --> 00:24.080
<b>Yes.</b>

00:24.080 --> 00:28.380
<b>We thought that effect would be
helpful elsewhere, as well,</b>

00:28.380 --> 00:30.710
<b>so we put some in the laundry room.</b>

00:30.710 --> 00:33.090
<b>And the slime ate it.</b>

00:33.090 --> 00:35.130
<b>Yes.</b>

00:35.130 --> 00:39.050
<b>According to Miss Maria and the others,
after it started eating charcoal,</b>

00:39.050 --> 00:43.390
<b>it gradually started eating
less laundry grime.</b>

00:43.390 --> 00:44.730
<b>I see...</b>

00:44.730 --> 00:49.400
<b>I'm sorry. It's my fault, since I was the one
tasked with taking care of the shop.</b>

00:49.400 --> 00:52.570
<b>Oh, no, don't worry about it.</b>

00:52.570 --> 00:57.320
<b>In fact, I want to thank you
for noticing this.</b>

00:57.320 --> 00:58.160
<b>Huh?</b>

00:58.160 --> 01:03.160
<b>Mr. Callum, that cleaner slime
is about to evolve.</b>

01:03.160 --> 01:05.540
<b>Evolve?</b>

01:05.540 --> 01:10.960
<b>Yes. When a slime evolves, it sometimes
gains new abilities and dietary habits.</b>

01:10.960 --> 01:14.130
<b>I'll take care of that slime, for now.</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:17.430
<b>If you see any other similar slimes,
please let me know.</b>

01:17.430 --> 01:22.770
<b>Yes, understood. I'll keep a record
of what they ate, too.</b>

01:26.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Ryoma, thank you for the letter.</b>

01:29.980 --> 01:35.610
<b>A cleaner slime evolving?
I am rather surprised!</b>

01:35.610 --> 01:38.780
<b>I wonder what kind of abilities
this new slime will get.</b>

01:38.780 --> 01:42.830
<b>Once it evolves,
please be sure to let me know!</b>

01:42.830 --> 01:47.160
<b>That story about the magic item market
was interesting, as well.</b>

01:47.160 --> 01:49.540
<b>I've never visited that market,</b>

01:49.540 --> 01:55.630
<b>so if you do, please write to me about it.</b>

01:55.630 --> 01:57.800
<b>I look forward to hearing about it.</b>

01:59.550 --> 02:01.720
<b>The magic item market...</b>

02:01.720 --> 02:07.940
<b>I am curious, but I do have
a business to run. What should I do?</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:45.990
<b>"Episode 5"
"Ryoma and the New Acquaintance"</b>

03:47.790 --> 03:49.830
<b>Did you need me, Manager?</b>

03:49.830 --> 03:54.630
<b>Yes. There's something personal
I wanted to discuss.</b>

03:54.630 --> 03:57.880
<b>Personal? What is it?</b>

03:57.880 --> 04:01.630
<b>I'm thinking about
going back to my hometown.</b>

04:01.630 --> 04:05.930
<b>I left behind some heirlooms
that my grandparents left me.</b>

04:05.930 --> 04:08.680
<b>I want to prepare for that trip,</b>

04:08.680 --> 04:13.310
<b>so I'd like to focus more on my work
as an adventurer from now on.</b>

04:13.310 --> 04:18.400
<b>I understand. In that case,
I will take care of the shop.</b>

04:18.400 --> 04:24.110
<b>So, Manager, you mentioned preparation,
but where is this hometown of yours?</b>

04:24.110 --> 04:28.370
<b>Well, it's in the Great Forest of Schluss...</b>

04:28.370 --> 04:31.500
<b>Wow, what's that look on your face?</b>

04:31.500 --> 04:36.170
<b>P-Pardon me. I was just surprised.</b>

04:36.170 --> 04:38.880
<b>I'm surprised you're alive, Manager.</b>

04:38.880 --> 04:41.760
<b>So you know about the Great Forest.</b>

04:41.760 --> 04:46.090
<b>A dense forest filled with
countless monsters.</b>

04:46.090 --> 04:49.220
<b>I have heard that it's one of the most
dangerous places in the world.</b>

04:49.220 --> 04:52.430
<b>It's a miracle you made it out alive.</b>

04:53.890 --> 04:58.690
<b>I plan to raise my rank as an adventurer
and go back the proper way.</b>

04:58.690 --> 05:02.360
<b>So it'll be a while before
I actually go out there.</b>

05:02.360 --> 05:06.820
<b>If that's your decision, I won't stop you.</b>

05:06.820 --> 05:11.950
<b>But please, do make sure you prepare
as well as you possibly can.</b>

05:11.950 --> 05:14.040
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

05:14.040 --> 05:19.040
<b>That's why I'm going to go
to the guild to discuss this.</b>

05:19.040 --> 05:24.630
<b>Is it all right to ask you to
take care of the shop now?</b>

05:24.630 --> 05:28.220
<b>I understand. Please have a safe trip.</b>

05:33.350 --> 05:35.270
<b>"Maylene, receptionist
at the Adventurer's Guild"</b>

05:36.850 --> 05:40.650
<b>Oh hello, Ryoma. Working over here today?</b>

05:40.650 --> 05:42.070
<b>Yes.</b>

05:44.570 --> 05:50.200
<b>My business is running smoothly now,
so I'd like to do more adventurer work.</b>

05:50.200 --> 05:55.120
<b>Oh, that's good news.
Well, let's see what we have...</b>

05:55.120 --> 06:00.710
<b>About that, there's something
I wanted to discuss, if that's okay.</b>

06:00.710 --> 06:03.340
<b>Of course, anything--</b>

06:03.340 --> 06:05.760
<b>N-No!</b>

06:05.760 --> 06:07.550
<b>--Come on, just one drink after work.</b>

06:07.550 --> 06:10.970
<b>--Oh, no. One moment.
--Come on, just one drink after work.</b>

06:13.430 --> 06:17.140
<b>Come on, you fools. Stop picking on her!</b>

06:17.140 --> 06:19.190
<b>Oh, Miss Maylene.</b>

06:19.190 --> 06:22.980
<b>Um, I guess we overdid it.</b>

06:22.980 --> 06:28.110
<b>If you got a job, stop chatting
and go and get it done!</b>

06:28.110 --> 06:30.030
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

06:39.210 --> 06:40.790
<b>Is there a problem?</b>

06:40.790 --> 06:43.210
<b>Yeah, just a little thing.</b>

06:43.210 --> 06:47.170
<b>First, let me introduce you to Paena.</b>

06:47.170 --> 06:49.050
<b>She started here last week.</b>

06:49.050 --> 06:52.470
<b>I-I'm Paena. Nice to meet you.</b>

06:52.470 --> 06:56.720
<b>I'm Ryoma Takebayashi.
Nice to meet you, too.</b>

06:56.720 --> 07:01.440
<b>As you could probably tell,
she's a bit of a pushover.</b>

07:01.440 --> 07:03.860
<b>Um... I'm sorry...</b>

07:03.860 --> 07:08.190
<b>Mr. Ryoma, can I put her
in charge of your issue?</b>

07:08.190 --> 07:11.200
<b>I want her to get more experience quickly.</b>

07:11.200 --> 07:13.870
<b>I'll support her, too.</b>

07:13.870 --> 07:16.540
<b>Sure, that's fine.</b>

07:19.120 --> 07:23.750
<b>Y-Yes. S-So please tell us what you need.</b>

07:23.750 --> 07:27.050
<b>Right. It's about
my activities moving forward.</b>

07:27.050 --> 07:29.800
<b>I've set a new goal.</b>

07:29.800 --> 07:34.640
<b>I'm currently at rank E,
and I'd like to raise that to C.</b>

07:34.640 --> 07:36.260
<b>Also...</b>

07:38.680 --> 07:42.440
<b>I'm looking for jobs
that involve these monsters.</b>

07:42.440 --> 07:44.480
<b>Let me take a look.</b>

07:44.480 --> 07:49.690
<b>Treant, mad salamander, calif monkey...</b>

07:50.690 --> 07:54.740
<b>Some of these aren't suited
for rank E adventurers.</b>

07:54.740 --> 07:57.990
<b>I'll take those on as I raise my rank.</b>

07:58.990 --> 08:03.960
<b>But I'd like to get information
on them beforehand.</b>

08:04.960 --> 08:08.920
<b>I heard the guild has
that kind of information.</b>

08:08.920 --> 08:12.090
<b>Yes! How much would you need?</b>

08:12.090 --> 08:15.550
<b>Let's see... I'd like to
learn basic information,</b>

08:15.550 --> 08:19.890
<b>like their biology and their habitat,
with the latest information you have.</b>

08:19.890 --> 08:20.720
<b>Understood--</b>

08:20.720 --> 08:24.140
<b>Also! About the Great Forest of Schluss.</b>

08:24.140 --> 08:28.110
<b>I'd like to learn about
the monsters in that area.</b>

08:28.110 --> 08:29.360
<b>Huh?</b>

08:29.360 --> 08:34.490
<b>Wait, you're trying to go to <i>that</i> forest?</b>

08:36.530 --> 08:39.620
<b>Yes. Actually...</b>

08:45.710 --> 08:50.920
<b>I see... Your grandparents' heirlooms...</b>

08:50.920 --> 08:55.590
<b>I'm sorry, I spoke out
before I learned your reasons.</b>

08:55.590 --> 09:01.180
<b>As long as you're willing to prepare properly,
we have no right to stop you.</b>

09:01.180 --> 09:02.980
<b>Please continue.</b>

09:02.980 --> 09:04.890
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:04.890 --> 09:08.310
<b>All right, Paena,
please prepare the contract.</b>

09:08.310 --> 09:10.270
<b>R-Right!</b>

09:10.270 --> 09:14.570
<b>I didn't know you're from that forest.</b>

09:14.570 --> 09:17.360
<b>Do you know that area well?</b>

09:17.360 --> 09:24.080
<b>Thanks to my line of work, yes.
But it explains a lot.</b>

09:24.080 --> 09:25.660
<b>Explains?</b>

09:25.660 --> 09:31.380
<b>Compared to other kids your age,
your abilities are way too high.</b>

09:31.380 --> 09:36.720
<b>But if you're from that forest,
it's only natural.</b>

09:36.720 --> 09:38.430
<b>Thank you for waiting!</b>

09:38.430 --> 09:39.390
<b>So fast!</b>

09:39.390 --> 09:42.510
<b>Maylene, please take a look.</b>

09:42.510 --> 09:43.850
<b>Yes.</b>

09:44.680 --> 09:47.480
<b>Yes, it looks fine.</b>

09:47.480 --> 09:49.150
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:49.150 --> 09:55.440
<b>In that case, please confirm the content
and sign if everything is in order.</b>

09:55.440 --> 09:59.030
<b>There's... no problem.</b>

10:04.240 --> 10:06.000
<b>All right, here it is.</b>

10:06.000 --> 10:09.080
<b>Yes, accepted!</b>

10:09.080 --> 10:12.540
<b>Here is the proof of the exchange.</b>

10:12.540 --> 10:17.260
<b>You'll need it when coming back for the item.
Please make sure you don't lose it.</b>

10:17.260 --> 10:21.350
<b>Understood. Item Box.</b>

10:23.760 --> 10:26.680
<b>All right, that contract is complete.</b>

10:26.680 --> 10:29.980
<b>So, Ryoma, will you be taking on any jobs?</b>

10:29.980 --> 10:34.690
<b>It would help us a lot.</b>

10:34.690 --> 10:38.780
<b>Yes. I don't mind if it's a bit tough,</b>

10:38.780 --> 10:43.530
<b>but is there something short-term
that might let me raise my rank quickly?</b>

10:43.530 --> 10:47.710
<b>A short-term job that might
let you gain ranks quickly...</b>

10:47.710 --> 10:50.040
<b>Oh! In that case...</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:51.170
<b>So fast!</b>

10:51.170 --> 10:53.750
<b>Thank you for waiting.</b>

10:53.750 --> 10:57.420
<b>How about this one?</b>

10:59.800 --> 11:05.060
<b>Let's see. Parcel delivery, to Keleban.</b>

11:05.060 --> 11:08.140
<b>The time limit is...
"As soon as possible"?</b>

11:08.140 --> 11:14.650
<b>Y-Yes! They sent the carriage out before
realizing they forgot to load the parcel.</b>

11:14.650 --> 11:18.280
<b>So their desired delivery date is noon,
day after tomorrow.</b>

11:18.280 --> 11:22.320
<b>The day after tomorrow?!
That sounds impossible.</b>

11:22.320 --> 11:27.160
<b>Yes, so they won't
penalize for any delays.</b>

11:27.160 --> 11:28.410
<b>But...</b>

11:28.410 --> 11:32.250
<b>I noticed you were using
space magic earlier,</b>

11:32.250 --> 11:35.630
<b>so I thought perhaps you could
make it there on time.</b>

11:35.630 --> 11:37.500
<b>Ah.</b>

11:37.500 --> 11:39.260
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:39.260 --> 11:43.760
<b>No, thank you very much
for your solid service.</b>

11:43.760 --> 11:47.060
<b>Yes, she's really good at her job.</b>

11:47.060 --> 11:50.730
<b>That's why I keep telling her
to be less timid.</b>

11:50.730 --> 11:52.190
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

11:52.190 --> 11:55.770
<b>All right, I'll take this job.</b>

11:55.770 --> 11:58.730
<b>Yes! Thank you!</b>

11:58.730 --> 12:01.780
<b>Keleban... That's the town
that Mr. Serge was talking about,</b>

12:01.780 --> 12:04.620
<b>where the magic item market
is taking place.</b>

12:04.620 --> 12:08.540
<b>I did want to check it out.
This is a good opportunity!</b>

12:10.450 --> 12:14.710
<b>I'm so happy, I'm so timid, I'm Paena.</b>

12:15.460 --> 12:20.340
<b>I could have told a cool story if I had
30 seconds, but I only have five.</b>

12:24.390 --> 12:27.100
<b>Welcome to Keleban.</b>

12:27.100 --> 12:29.140
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:30.520 --> 12:32.390
<b>That's quite a crowd.</b>

12:32.390 --> 12:35.350
<b>Yes. The market is starting tomorrow.</b>

12:35.350 --> 12:38.150
<b>This upcoming market is for magic items.</b>

12:38.150 --> 12:42.190
<b>You mean, there are other
types of markets?</b>

12:42.190 --> 12:45.700
<b>Yes, there are six markets every year.</b>

12:45.700 --> 12:50.200
<b>There are many food stalls coming, too.
Please enjoy your stay.</b>

12:50.200 --> 12:53.250
<b>Yes, I will.</b>

12:58.250 --> 13:01.460
<b>Dinome's Magic Item Workshop...</b>

13:01.460 --> 13:03.130
<b>This must be the place.</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:04.970
<b>Item Box.</b>

13:08.550 --> 13:10.720
<b>Pardon me.</b>

13:15.850 --> 13:20.650
<b>Excuse me, is anyone here?</b>

13:20.650 --> 13:23.530
<b>Yeah, hold on a second.</b>

13:24.780 --> 13:27.740
<b>Hmm? What's a kid doing here?</b>

13:27.740 --> 13:32.120
<b>I'm on a job from the Adventurer's Guild
to deliver a parcel.</b>

13:33.160 --> 13:35.460
<b>Sign here, please.</b>

13:35.460 --> 13:37.830
<b>Oh, here already?!</b>

13:37.830 --> 13:43.050
<b>I didn't think it would
make it on time. Thanks!</b>

13:43.050 --> 13:45.010
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:47.180 --> 13:48.220
<b>I'll excuse myself--</b>

13:48.220 --> 13:49.390
<b>Hold up.</b>

13:49.390 --> 13:50.470
<b>Yes?</b>

13:50.470 --> 13:52.350
<b>You came all the way from Gimul, right?</b>

13:52.350 --> 13:55.060
<b>The least I could do
is get you a cup of tea.</b>

13:55.060 --> 13:56.350
<b>Here.</b>

13:57.230 --> 13:58.900
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:00.980 --> 14:06.610
<b>Hmm? This tastes more like
coffee than tea.</b>

14:06.610 --> 14:10.070
<b>This is delicious. What kind of tea is it?</b>

14:10.070 --> 14:12.280
<b>It's the root of a flower named dante.</b>

14:12.280 --> 14:15.250
<b>It's supposed to be good for your health.</b>

14:16.410 --> 14:22.340
<b>Dante... Dandelion coffee?
So they make this here, as well.</b>

14:25.760 --> 14:27.470
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:27.470 --> 14:30.640
<b>Yeah. Thanks for the package.</b>

14:30.640 --> 14:32.850
<b>You're welcome--</b>

14:32.850 --> 14:37.430
<b>Hey, you're finally here, Mr. Serge!</b>

14:38.890 --> 14:40.480
<b>Mr. Ryoma?</b>

14:40.480 --> 14:41.980
<b>Mr. Serge?</b>

14:41.980 --> 14:45.780
<b>What, kid, you know him?</b>

14:45.780 --> 14:50.070
<b>Yes, I get his support
in many ways at Gimul.</b>

14:50.070 --> 14:54.370
<b>Oh, no, in fact, we're the ones
getting support from Mr. Ryoma.</b>

14:54.370 --> 14:57.500
<b>What brings you here?</b>

14:57.500 --> 15:02.210
<b>I was delivering a package
as an adventurer. What about you?</b>

15:02.210 --> 15:07.670
<b>This is one of the magic item
workshops that I frequent.</b>

15:07.670 --> 15:09.930
<b>I came to say hello
before the market began.</b>

15:09.930 --> 15:12.140
<b>I see.</b>

15:12.140 --> 15:17.890
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.
I failed to greet you, Mr. Dinome.</b>

15:17.890 --> 15:24.730
<b>Never mind that. It's interesting
that you two know each other, though.</b>

15:24.730 --> 15:26.900
<b>I'm Dinome. Nice to meet you.</b>

15:26.900 --> 15:31.610
<b>Likewise. I'm Ryoma Takebayashi.</b>

15:31.610 --> 15:34.620
<b>Mr. Serge, I want to show you something.</b>

15:34.620 --> 15:38.870
<b>Ryoma, you want to take a look, too?</b>

15:38.870 --> 15:40.500
<b>Are you sure?</b>

15:40.500 --> 15:42.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:42.250 --> 15:44.170
<b>Wow...</b>

15:44.170 --> 15:49.050
<b>Feel free to look around,
just don't touch anything.</b>

15:49.050 --> 15:50.720
<b>Mr. Serge, yours is this way.</b>

15:50.720 --> 15:52.180
<b>Yes.</b>

15:52.180 --> 15:55.470
<b>So this is the latest magimobile...</b>

15:55.470 --> 15:59.390
<b>I've improved the engine
and lightened the chassis.</b>

15:59.390 --> 16:01.060
<b>I see.</b>

16:01.060 --> 16:04.230
<b>If it's about the magimobiles,
they must be discussing hobby stuff.</b>

16:04.230 --> 16:07.360
<b>I should stay out of it.</b>

16:09.400 --> 16:14.240
<b>Mr. Dinome, is this a magic item, too?</b>

16:14.240 --> 16:19.790
<b>Hmm? Oh, that one's not a magic item,
it's just a normal carriage.</b>

16:19.790 --> 16:23.080
<b>A neighbor asked me to repair it.</b>

16:23.080 --> 16:29.090
<b>Oh, that's rare. You used to turn down
all non-magic item related jobs.</b>

16:29.090 --> 16:32.170
<b>Well, there's... something.</b>

16:32.170 --> 16:37.100
<b>I need money... for my grandson.</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:40.470
<b>I see, for your grandson.</b>

16:40.470 --> 16:45.230
<b>Is it a gift? I could lend my aid,
if you'd like.</b>

16:45.230 --> 16:47.560
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

16:47.560 --> 16:52.650
<b>It's tuition. I want to
send him to the academy.</b>

16:52.650 --> 16:54.240
<b>The academy?</b>

16:54.240 --> 16:55.780
<b>In the capital?</b>

16:55.780 --> 16:58.450
<b>Yeah. The reason is...</b>

16:58.450 --> 17:01.120
<b>My grandson might be a great genius!</b>

17:01.120 --> 17:01.660
<b>--He's only turned four years old,
but check this out!</b>

17:01.660 --> 17:04.250
<b>--Uh oh, I have a bad feeling...
--He's only turned four years old,
but check this out!</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:07.290
<b>--He's only turned four years old,
but check this out!</b>

17:07.290 --> 17:09.000
<b>Your grandson made this?</b>

17:09.000 --> 17:13.170
<b>You see?! Yes! Isn't it awesome?!</b>

17:13.170 --> 17:18.680
<b>It's not something I could sell,
but a four-year-old kid did this!</b>

17:20.260 --> 17:21.970
<b>Good work.</b>

17:21.970 --> 17:25.390
<b>You, too. By the way...</b>

17:25.390 --> 17:28.360
<b>What should I do with this?</b>

17:28.360 --> 17:31.360
<b>I couldn't turn it down,
given how the conversation was going.</b>

17:31.360 --> 17:37.160
<b>You get it, nice! I like you!
Here, have this!</b>

17:37.160 --> 17:40.030
<b>Um, thank you...</b>

17:40.030 --> 17:43.370
<b>You should keep it.</b>

17:43.370 --> 17:47.710
<b>You might disappoint him
if you try to give it back.</b>

17:47.710 --> 17:50.340
<b>Yes, I see.</b>

17:50.340 --> 17:53.710
<b>By the way, Mr. Ryoma,
what do you have planned for today?</b>

17:53.710 --> 17:56.380
<b>I'll need to find a place to stay.</b>

17:56.380 --> 18:00.850
<b>Since I'm here, I'm thinking of staying
to see the market before heading back.</b>

18:00.850 --> 18:05.730
<b>I see. In that case, I can introduce you
to the inn I'm staying at.</b>

18:05.730 --> 18:08.770
<b>I can show you around
the market tomorrow, if you like.</b>

18:08.770 --> 18:10.020
<b>Are you sure?</b>

18:10.020 --> 18:12.070
<b>Of course.</b>

18:12.070 --> 18:18.160
<b>Thank you, Mr. Serge.
I'll take you up on that offer.</b>

18:20.200 --> 18:22.200
<b>So, Mr. Ryoma.</b>

18:22.200 --> 18:26.750
<b>I have several more places to visit,
but I'll be back in the evening.</b>

18:26.750 --> 18:28.620
<b>Let's have dinner together.</b>

18:28.620 --> 18:30.960
<b>Yes, please.</b>

18:33.250 --> 18:35.760
<b>Let's see.</b>

18:36.970 --> 18:41.140
<b>I have some free time
until Mr. Serge comes back.</b>

18:45.680 --> 18:48.730
<b>Maybe I'll try making
something with this...</b>

19:01.990 --> 19:03.240
<b>Mr. Ryoma?</b>

19:03.240 --> 19:05.790
<b>Oh, welcome back Mr. Serge!</b>

19:05.790 --> 19:09.160
<b>Dinner, right?
I'll get ready straight away.</b>

19:12.250 --> 19:14.090
<b>It's very popular.</b>

19:14.090 --> 19:16.710
<b>It's the night before the market.</b>

19:16.710 --> 19:18.590
<b>By the way, Mr. Ryoma.</b>

19:18.590 --> 19:22.090
<b>It seemed like you were working on
something quite passionately.</b>

19:22.090 --> 19:25.430
<b>Were you working on a magic item?</b>

19:25.430 --> 19:27.310
<b>You saw.</b>

19:27.310 --> 19:32.810
<b>I knew it! May I take a look,
if you don't mind?</b>

19:32.810 --> 19:35.610
<b>Yes, sure.</b>

19:37.070 --> 19:38.650
<b>What is...</b>

19:38.650 --> 19:41.070
<b>It's called a music box.</b>

19:41.860 --> 19:43.030
<b>Ah.</b>

19:43.030 --> 19:48.870
<b>It plays music, like this.
A toy, I guess, not a tool.</b>

19:50.540 --> 19:52.120
<b>Mr. Serge?</b>

19:52.120 --> 19:54.960
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

19:54.960 --> 19:57.460
<b>I've never seen anything like this before.</b>

19:57.460 --> 20:00.380
<b>Huh? These things don't exist?</b>

20:00.380 --> 20:05.220
<b>No. There are magic items
that are musical instruments,</b>

20:05.220 --> 20:08.770
<b>but nothing that
automatically plays music.</b>

20:08.770 --> 20:12.310
<b>Mr. Ryoma, you mentioned
earlier that it's a toy.</b>

20:12.310 --> 20:16.690
<b>There are many nobles that are
very fond of toys like these.</b>

20:16.690 --> 20:20.570
<b>If you put some effort into its
appearance, it will definitely sell.</b>

20:20.570 --> 20:23.660
<b>It would be a waste
not to bring this idea to fruition.</b>

20:23.660 --> 20:24.950
<b>I see.</b>

20:24.950 --> 20:30.450
<b>But I have to take on adventuring jobs,
as well as take care of my shop.</b>

20:30.450 --> 20:32.620
<b>I can't make these myself...</b>

20:32.620 --> 20:34.790
<b>Yes. In that case--</b>

20:34.790 --> 20:41.720
<b>Thanks for waiting! Here's our special,
steaks with herb butter!</b>

20:43.090 --> 20:45.640
<b>We can discuss this later.</b>

20:45.640 --> 20:47.550
<b>Indeed.</b>

20:47.550 --> 20:49.390
<b>Thank you for the food.</b>

20:49.390 --> 20:53.600
<b>Thank you for the interesting item.</b>

20:53.600 --> 20:56.270
<b>Mr. Ryoma, about the discussion earlier,</b>

20:56.270 --> 20:59.780
<b>if you're willing to sell them,
you should probably commission someone.</b>

20:59.780 --> 21:02.700
<b>Yes, I thought so, too.</b>

21:02.700 --> 21:05.320
<b>But who to ask...</b>

21:05.320 --> 21:11.040
<b>I have several ideas,
but why don't you ask Mr. Dinome?</b>

21:11.040 --> 21:14.420
<b>He already seems to like you.</b>

21:15.870 --> 21:18.540
<b>Wouldn't that be a burden for him, though?</b>

21:18.540 --> 21:24.380
<b>He should be fine.
He has three apprentices.</b>

21:24.380 --> 21:28.970
<b>Moreover, there's the issue
of his grandson's tuition.</b>

21:28.970 --> 21:35.060
<b>I'm sure he would appreciate
any offers for a job, at the very least.</b>

21:35.060 --> 21:36.060
<b>Ah.</b>

21:36.060 --> 21:41.940
<b>If you'd like, I can bring it up
with Mr. Dinome tomorrow.</b>

21:41.940 --> 21:43.240
<b>What do you think?</b>

21:43.240 --> 21:46.070
<b>Yes, please.</b>

21:48.320 --> 21:52.200
<b>Dear Lady Eliaria Jamil.</b>

21:52.200 --> 21:55.910
<b>Right now, I'm visiting
a town named Keleban.</b>

21:55.910 --> 22:00.500
<b>It's the town where the magic item market
that I mentioned earlier is taking place.</b>

22:00.500 --> 22:02.960
<b>The market begins tomorrow.</b>

22:02.960 --> 22:09.600
<b>I wonder what I'll find at the market.
I'll let you know in my next letter!</b>

22:09.600 --> 22:11.600
<b></b>

22:11.600 --> 22:13.600
<b></b>
